{"id":"e4f9f10bc85fd486","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-sigma-k-p.md","title":"df-sigma-k-p (Σₖᵖ Complexity Class)","display":"df-sigma-k-p (Σₖᵖ Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"display":"df-sigma-k-p (Σₖᵖ Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-sigma-k-p","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-sigma-k-p","Sigma-k-P","Σₖᵖ Complexity Class"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-k-p (Σₖᵖ Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-sigma-k-p"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-sigma-k-p</span><span>Sigma-k-P</span><span>Σₖᵖ Complexity Class</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\">\\(\\mathbf P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见本目录对应定义；多输入均通过 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tup}_j:(\\{0,1\\}^*)^j\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\operatorname{tup}_j:(\\{0,1\\}^*)^j\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 编码送入一元函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q_i^{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf Q_i^{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 是公式前缀中的量词符号，以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的奇偶定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q y\\in D\">\\(\\mathsf Q y\\in D\\)</span> 表示有界量词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf Q_i^{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\forall,&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf Q_i^{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&amp;i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\forall,&amp;i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists g\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\\\\n&amp;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf Q_1^{\\Sigma}y_1\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+2)^a}\\cdots\n\\mathsf Q_k^{\\Sigma}y_k\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+2)^a}\\;\ng(\\operatorname{tup}_{k+1}(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_k))=1\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\exists g\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\\\\n&amp;\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf Q_1^{\\Sigma}y_1\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+2)^a}\\cdots\n\\mathsf Q_k^{\\Sigma}y_k\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+2)^a}\\;\ng(\\operatorname{tup}_{k+1}(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_k))=1\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>量词块数为与输入无关的常数，量词内字符串长度为多项式。统一的多项式长度可由填充取得；末尾判定只接受输出串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>。相反的首量词给出补类，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\Sigma_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{coNP}\">\\(\\Pi_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{coNP}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定义5.3；印刷97页；PDF123页。量词次序及补类关系已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathbf P$、$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见本目录对应定义；多输入均通过 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]] 的 $\\operatorname{tup}_j:(\\{0,1\\}^*)^j\\to\\{0,1\\}^*$ 编码送入一元函数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tup}_j:(\\{0,1\\}^*)^j\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf Q_i^{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf Q y\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf Q_i^{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\exists,&i\\equiv1\\pmod2,\\\\\\forall,&i\\equiv0\\pmod2,\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\Sigma_0^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\mathbf P.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\exists g\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\;\\exists a,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\\\\n&\\left(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathsf Q_1^{\\Sigma}y_1\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+2)^a}\\cdots\n\\mathsf Q_k^{\\Sigma}y_k\\in\\{0,1\\}^{c(|x|+2)^a}\\;\ng(\\operatorname{tup}_{k+1}(x,y_1,\\ldots,y_k))=1\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1^{\\mathbf P}=\\mathbf{coNP}","display":false}],"bytes":1654,"backlinks":[{"id":"1b55a40958811c5e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\mathbf P$、$\\Sigma_{k-1}^{\\mathbf P}$ 与类预言机指数 $\\mathbf P^{\\mathcal C}$ 见 [[28-df-p]]、[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-oracle-class]]。"},{"id":"3490cd4d54ac2474","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma_k^{\\mathbf P}$、$\\Pi_k^{\\mathbf P}$ 见 [[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-pi-k-p]]，$k\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"91bfe52ee99ebd32","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf Q_i^\\Sigma$ 的量词次序见 [[28-df-sigma-k-p]]；每个 $\\mathbf x_i\\in\\mathrm{PropVar}^{<\\omega}$ 是有限无重复变量表，各表的变量互不相同。下文按有限列表长度递归定义块构造 $\\mathsf Q\\mathbf x\\,\\varphi$，其中 $\\mathsf Q\\in\\{\\exists,\\forall\\}$。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"多项式层级：[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]、[[28-df-pi-k-p]]、[[28-df-delta-k-p]]、[[28-df-ph]]、[[28-df-qbf-k]]、[[28-thm-qbf-k-complete]]。"},{"id":"1d49ae3afc38197f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e4a27d2149a6ed33","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"50694dc705d2290e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b9f22036ffa6885b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"exc